{%- set contact = site.enterpriseContact -%}
      <section class="ent-hero ent-hero--tight">
        <h1>Support</h1>
        <p class="ent-lede">Write to us. A person reads every message.</p>
      </section>

      <article class="ent-doc">
        <h2>Becoming a design partner</h2>
        <p>We’re building OpenShore with a small group of startups. To talk about joining them, write to <a href="mailto:{{ contact }}?subject={{ 'Design partner: OpenShore' | urlencode }}">{{ contact }}</a>.</p>

        <h2>Signing in to the platform page or the product tour</h2>
        <p>Each username we give out works for up to 7 days. If yours has ended or does not work, write to <a href="mailto:{{ contact }}?subject={{ 'Platform access' | urlencode }}">{{ contact }}</a> and we’ll send a new one.</p>

        <h2>Privacy requests</h2>
        <p>To ask for a copy of what we hold about you, or to have it corrected or deleted, write to <a href="mailto:{{ contact }}?subject={{ 'Privacy request' | urlencode }}">{{ contact }}</a>. Our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains what we collect.</p>

        <h2>Help with OS Code by OpenShore</h2>
        <p>OS Code by OpenShore, our free personal coding agent, has its own <a href="/os-code/support/">support page</a>.</p>
      </article>
